(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - LT8648S (Analog Devices LT8648S Rev E, Applications Information; replicates Fig.10)\nDesign point: VIN 12 V nom (6-42 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 15 A, fSW 400 kHz\nFB divider: R1 = R2*(VOUT/0.600 - 1) ; R1 = 100k, R2 = 22.1k -> VOUT = 3.315 V ; phase-lead CFF 33pF across R1\nFrequency: RT = 44.8/fSW[MHz] - 5.9 = 106.1k -> 105k (E96)\nInductor: L = (VOUT + VSW(BOT))/fSW[MHz] * 0.2 = 1.68 uH -> 2.2uH XAL8080-222ME\n  dIL = VOUT/(L*fSW)*(1-VOUT/VINmax) = 3.46 A ; IOUT(MAX) = ILIM - dIL/2 = 30 - 1.73 = 28.3 A\nEN/UV: VIN(EN) = (R3/R4 + 1)*0.98V ; R4 = 100k, VIN(EN) = 6.0 V -> R3 = 511k\nSoft-start: tSS = CSS*VFB/ISS = 10nF*0.60V/2.0uA = 3.0 ms ; PG 10k pull-up to VOUT (house-common) ; BIAS to VOUT\nSYNC/MODE to GND (Burst Mode); CLKOUT n/c. Silent Switcher: split CIN symmetrically across both VIN pin groups.\nExternal comp (VC): RC 6.65k + CC 820pF per datasheet Fig.10 ; INTVCC 1uF\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=12V nom / 42V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=15A, fSW=400kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.275\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 2.72A @nom, 3.46A @max  (23% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 16.73A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 34A (max top-switch limit)  (XAL8080-222ME)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 6.70A (max IOUT/2 = 7.50A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 748mV with CIN_eff=10uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 8.9mV with COUT_eff=95uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 196ns vs tON_MIN(max)=40ns -> OK\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 206.2V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 4.22V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=2.07W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.14W (tsw~4ns), Pq=0.04W\n  RDS_HS=12mOhm, RDS_LS=4mOhm typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 2.25W ; thetaJA = 15 C/W (ADI demo board) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 59C @25C, 119C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 91C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.43W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ce58921-4d01-45fd-aa46-eca42484a324"))
